# Line-ending fence (P20 convergence).
#
# Shell scripts and Rust sources are executed/compiled inside Linux
# containers. A CRLF working tree breaks them (`\r: command not found`),
# and core.autocrlf=true on a Windows host would otherwise smudge every
# text file to CRLF on checkout. Pin these paths to LF in every working
# tree, independent of the host's core.autocrlf setting.
#
# Deliberately narrow: only paths that are executed or compiled in a
# Linux container. This is not an aesthetic repo-wide normalization and
# it does not rewrite any existing file.

*.sh text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
